            "slug": "services",
            "excerpt": "One pet at a time, no cages and no rushing — grooming and care built around how animals actually feel.",
            "featured_image": "@samoyed",
            "body": "<p>All of our groomers are trained in low-stress handling. We book generous appointment times, take breaks whenever your pet needs one and talk you through everything we notice along the way, from a matted patch to a sore paw. Appointments can be booked in the boutique, by phone or through the contact page.</p>",
