        {
            "schema": "shop_page",
            "days_ago": 60,
            "title": "Delivery & Returns",
            "slug": "delivery-returns",
            "excerpt": "Everything you need to know about local delivery, collection and returns.",
            "body": "<h2>Local delivery</h2><p>We deliver within eight miles of the boutique from Tuesday to Saturday. Delivery is complimentary on orders over $60 and $6 below that. Orders placed before 2 pm usually arrive the next day.</p><h2>Click & collect</h2><p>Reserve anything by phone or email and collect it from the boutique during opening hours. We will hold it for seven days.</p><h2>Returns</h2><p>Unused items in their original packaging can be returned within 30 days for a full refund or exchange. For hygiene reasons we can’t take back opened treats, food or grooming products. Beds that turn out to be the wrong size can be exchanged as long as the cover is unwashed.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Write to <a href=\"mailto:hello@velvetpaw.example\">hello@velvetpaw.example</a> or call us on +1 (555) 014-2290.</p>",
            "metadata": {
                "eyebrow": "Good to know",
                "subtitle": "Delivery & *returns*"
            }
